/* ==================================================================
   C E L E R I U M
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   Black Ops II  //  Cronus Zen / GPC                     v1.1
   OFFLINE / BOT-LOBBY / CAMPAIGN / ZOMBIES BUILD
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   MENU        : hold L2 + tap OPTIONS
   MASTER KILL : hold L2 + tap SHARE  (all mods on/off instantly)

   IN MENU:
     D-UP / D-DOWN ....... move cursor
     D-LEFT / D-RIGHT .... change value (hold to fast-scroll)
     L1 / R1 ............. previous / next page
     CROSS ............... toggle / run action
     TRIANGLE ............ reset this line to default
     CIRCLE .............. save + exit

   NOTE ON GPC: this language has NO local variables. Every working
   variable is declared at top level, prefixed by the function that
   owns it, so nothing collides. Strings must live in the data
   section as const string arrays - print() takes an address, not a
   literal, and there is no %d, so numbers go through putc_oled().
   ================================================================== */


